    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FPS Coloring game</h2>Your goal is to color 2D and 3D object. For that you just need to look at them and click on the highlighted parts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938440/extras/3d0f8529269f3de06797629750fc5ba8.avif?t=1722119979\" width=646 height=578 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online multiplayer</h2>You can play alone or with your friends, as long as your pc can handle it you can have more friend in your lobby.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938440/extras/806769c29b37f3724f6a07524ef046b0.avif?t=1722119979\" width=600 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Penguin and Laser Eyes</h2>Like those in real life, you'll be penguin coloring with their laser eyes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938440/extras/f7a93e374952f4a9dfff644d9a1dc645.avif?t=1722119979\" width=700 height=620 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wearable</h2>Wear cool hats and other stuff that you painted and for free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats</h2>Most cool stats are recorded (time spent coloring an object, accuracy, and other cool stuff)",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FPS Coloring game</h2>Your goal is to color 2D and 3D object. For that you just need to look at them and click on the highlighted parts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938440/extras/3d0f8529269f3de06797629750fc5ba8.avif?t=1722119979\" width=646 height=578 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online multiplayer</h2>You can play alone or with your friends, as long as your pc can handle it you can have more friend in your lobby.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938440/extras/806769c29b37f3724f6a07524ef046b0.avif?t=1722119979\" width=600 height=390 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Penguin and Laser Eyes</h2>Like those in real life, you'll be penguin coloring with their laser eyes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938440/extras/f7a93e374952f4a9dfff644d9a1dc645.avif?t=1722119979\" width=700 height=620 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wearable</h2>Wear cool hats and other stuff that you painted and for free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats</h2>Most cool stats are recorded (time spent coloring an object, accuracy, and other cool stuff)",
